From 9f075f68e97a7175212f0f285953c359e61d575d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rd-fork <rd-fork@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:00:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] 0004 P3 ConfidentialDvp

New instruction ConfidentialDvp: DFABI and RD ZkTransfer legs executed together or not at all,
two signed intents over one tuple (trade id, chain id, expiry height, legs' asset, nullifiers
and outputs), single-use trade id and award id in WSV, optional BI-signed award for UC-03.
Legs run through the stock ZkTransfer execution so P2 and all proof checks apply.
